stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> active : issued at submit or by the clinic
    active --> expired : expires_at passes - 24 hours by default
    active --> revoked : clinic revokes
    active --> revoked : order closes or is rejected
    active --> used_up : used_count reaches max_uses - never set today
    expired --> [*]
    revoked --> [*]
    used_up --> [*]
